==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{term/t|la|diēs||day}} and {{term|lunae|lang=la}}, genitive of {{term|luna||moon|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
'''[[dies#Latin|dies]] [[luna#Latin|Lunae]]''' {{g|m|f}}

# [[Monday]]

